# {{DISPLAY_NAME}}

Plamenix plugin (`{{PLUGIN_ID}}`).

## Build

```sh
# Rust half — compiles to wasm32-wasip2 + writes plugin.wasm.
cargo build --target wasm32-wasip2 --release
cp target/wasm32-wasip2/release/*.wasm plugin.wasm

# UI half — produces ui.mjs.
npm run build
```

## Pack + install

```sh
plamenix pack .                       # produces <plugin>.plx
plamenix install ./<plugin>.plx       # registers + activates in the running host
```
